    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_Dng08Gro43_Theme:SubEv_Dng08Gro43_Theme_030:cc6aed32",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_SubEv_Dng08Gro43_Theme",
        "key": "SubEv_Dng08Gro43_Theme_030",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_Dng08Gro43_Theme:SubEv_Dng08Gro43_Theme_030:cc6aed32",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_Dng08Gro43_Theme:SubEv_Dng08Gro43_Theme_030:cc6aed32",
        "jp_sha256": "34e12ad18d5985adf1adcabd1f95baf60f8ea91a95ee3b9cf91a48112fbd885d",
        "official_en_sha256": "c8fc9779bcedba548d7ab8c6abc14b1ed299546b9c337699b40215072ec93f35"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "二人一組で協力して進んできた者よ。\r\n最後の試練は一対一の真剣勝負で行うものとする。\r\n勝ち残った者を最強とし、聖騎士の称号を与える。",
        "official_en": "You two—together—each trial you have won, now stand opposed in earnest till the final test is done. To the one whose victory is achieved, the title of Paladin shall be received.",
        "real_en": "You have come this far by working in pairs. The final trial will be a serious one-on-one duel. The victor shall be deemed the strongest and granted the title of Paladin."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
      "function": "dialogue_line",
      "context": {
