    {
      "record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_Dng08Gro43_Theme:SubEv_Dng08Gro43_Theme_005:324af616",
      "source": {
        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_SubEv_Dng08Gro43_Theme",
        "key": "SubEv_Dng08Gro43_Theme_005",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_Dng08Gro43_Theme:SubEv_Dng08Gro43_Theme_005:324af616",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_SubEv_Dng08Gro43_Theme:SubEv_Dng08Gro43_Theme_005:324af616",
        "jp_sha256": "2870c02bdc827a5e16ea65b52a3d0cc0fa3d816f5ab4d36c7ab534293708f78b",
        "official_en_sha256": "4bd0e9c9a48f78c1616a58a2d892501b9d1b66e56d036db70d0125b82cc3fc7f"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "敵の必殺をいなすには様々な手段がある。\r\n逆鱗に触れぬように気をつけよ",
        "official_en": "There are many ways that one may know, to evade a foe’s most deadly blow—think carefully, think guilefully; lest you end in certain woe.",
        "real_en": "There are many ways to fend off an enemy's finishing move. Take care not to provoke its fury."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
      },
